WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.682
VP VNP over

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:02.602
Every Field

00:00:03.126 --> 00:00:04.670
Anthropic's formal-math

00:00:04.482 --> 00:00:06.298
repository now contains

00:00:06.121 --> 00:00:07.465
a machine-checked proof

00:00:07.277 --> 00:00:08.420
that VP is

00:00:08.232 --> 00:00:09.187
not equal to

00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:10.225
VNP over every

00:00:10.036 --> 00:00:10.720
field

00:00:11.254 --> 00:00:12.433
For every field

00:00:12.528 --> 00:00:13.353
circuits for the

00:00:13.164 --> 00:00:15.287
Hamiltonian cycle polynomial

00:00:15.511 --> 00:00:16.136
and for the

00:00:15.947 --> 00:00:17.822
permanent outside characteristic

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:18.176
2

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:19.296
need more than

00:00:19.143 --> 00:00:20.086
m c

00:00:20.275 --> 00:00:21.171
gates for all

00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:21.808
large m

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:23.430
The same holds

00:00:23.242 --> 00:00:24.869
for approximating circuits

00:00:25.008 --> 00:00:25.845
The result was

00:00:25.657 --> 00:00:26.659
