00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:27.767
internal research Claude

00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:28.180
model

00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:29.288
Both were written

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.361
by AI models

00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:31.199
and no human

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.449
mathematician has checked

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.038
